1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,500
The fifth process is <i>mengikir</i> or filing.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:11,900
<i>Mengikir</i> aims to shave the residue

3
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:18,800
left by the <i>cetar</i> tool
or grinding machine.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
The use of <i>kikir</i> file is divided
into three stages

5
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:26,240
according to our requirements.

6
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Namely, coarse file, fine file or

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
step file and its application differ

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
according to the filed area and residue left

9
00:00:38,724 --> 00:00:43,224
by the cetar tool or grinding machine.

10
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:51,180
Fine file is used to smoothen areas
previously filed by the coarse file,

11
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:55,040
while the step file serves to trim areas

12
00:00:55,064 --> 00:00:57,564
that cannot be reached

13
00:00:58,088 --> 00:01:01,588
by either coarse or fine file.
